  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy Advocacy and Outreach on Social Protection in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is intended to reinforce policy advocacy and engagement on social protection, advocate for mitigating the impact of the ongoing cost-of living crisis on vulnerable groups and to reinforce the messages of the 2024 . Regional Human Development Report which promotes social protection to address growing human insecurity and the risks and to build resilience against a turbulent future characterized by climate change impacts, technological transformation, and trade fragmentation.</narrative>
  </description>
